# Local development secrets for studio-api. Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) and replace every value.
# The code has no built-in fallbacks: a missing value fails with "Missing required secret <NAME>".
# In deployed environments set these with `wrangler secret put <NAME>`.
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=replace-with-32-plus-random-characters
PX_VAULT_KEY=replace-with-32-plus-random-characters
PX_CONN_KEY=replace-with-32-plus-random-characters
PX_TOKEN_KEK=replace-with-32-plus-random-characters
PX_TELEMETRY_SECRET=replace-with-32-plus-random-characters
# Optional: GitHub sign-in is enabled only when both are set.
# GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
# GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Optional: comma-separated user ids of platform operators, the only callers allowed to write all-tenant tables
# (global feature flags, meter definitions, plan prices) and create admin-console super-admins. Unset means nobody.
# PX_PLATFORM_OPERATORS=
